<name>Psu-143364 Family Map — Inocalla holdings</name>
<description>Master map of the Inocalla family parcels on and around Plan Psu-143364, Paracale / Jose Panganiban, Camarines Norte. Every polygon here is plotted from a validated technical description (traverse closure and area checked) anchored to the official BLBM No. 1 Batobalani monument. Grows one parcel at a time as sibling titles are transcribed and validated. Started 2026-09-22. FAMILY INVENTORY (15 rows, corroborated across corpus docs 520/669/1523/5121): 1) Lot 1 Psu-152027, T-3897, 23.0935 has (Vicente Jr./Cipriana/Jesus) · 2) Lot 1 Psu-152156, T-3424, 22.5178 (Beatriz/(Marilou+Allan)) · 3) Lot 2-B (LRC) Psd-56979, T-5656, 19.7727 (Vicente Sr./(Herbert+Senen)) · 4) Lot 2 Psu-143364, T-20754, 10.2928 (DBP/Casper) · 5) Lot 9-A Psd-05-012242, T-29841, 2.3513 (Marilou) · 6) Lot 8 Psu-143364 Amd., P-1617, 23.4356 (Jesus) · 7) Lot 6 Psu-143364, ARP 021-0312, 18.0003 (Vicente) · 8) Lot 10 Psu-143364, T-20756, 18.9591 (DBP/Casper) · 9) Lot 5 Psu-143363 Amd., T-20757, 23.5845 (DBP/Casper) · 10) H-128572, T-20755, 11.1486 (DBP/Casper) · 11) Lot 4 Psu-143364, P-1616, 15.2069 (Allan) [PLOTTED] · 12) Lot 7 Psu-143364 Amd., P-1516, 22.8024 (Vicente Jr.) · 13) Lot 1 Psu-143364 Amd., P-1615, 23.0238 (Cipriana) · 14) H-44920, T-2194, 13.3690 (Vicente/(Senen)) [PLOTTED] · 15) Lot 3 Psu-143364, T-4185, 11.3042 (Beatriz/(Herbert)). Traverses for the unplotted rows pending clean title photos, heightened OCR, or the SMD certified plan.</description>
