<Placemark><name>Lot 4, Psu-143364 — OCT P-1616 (Allan V. Inocalla)</name><styleUrl>#lot4</styleUrl>
<description>152,069 sqm / 15.2069 has. Free patent 1963 (FPA V-43979). Position: BLBM No. 1 + tie N 60°01' W × 3,508.83 m — bearing OFFICIALLY CONFIRMED by DENR SMD letter Ref. SMD-SCS-INC-26-172 (Sept 22, 2026). Traverse closure 0.07 m; area check 152,068.9 sqm. Accuracy ±20–30 m absolute (GPPC Certification pending will tighten to survey grade).</description>
