<Placemark><name>H-44920 / T-2194 — Vicente Inocalla homestead (1931) = Senen 2012 mining parcel</name><styleUrl>#vicente</styleUrl>
<description>133,690 sqm / 13.3690 has. Titled to VICENTE INOCALLA (m. Beatriz Villafria) via homestead patent, OCT No. 239 registered July 6, 1931 — identity CONFIRMED by three independent OCR copies in the corpus (docs 484, 634, tail copy): homestead H-44920, OCT registered July 6, 1931, current title T-2194 (family inventory row 14); course lists match the 2012 Senen mining sketch plan verbatim including S64°48'W 37.95 (validating the closure-derived correction) — this polygon uses the 2012 plan's validated boundary (closure 0.09 m). Tie N 57°49' W × 3,579.00 m from the same BLBM No. 1. Adjoins Lot 4 (shared boundary 0.1–0.2 m). Visible mine workings on 2026 Sentinel-2 imagery. [Identity: inferred_strong pending clean OCR of the 1931 title.]</description>
