<Folder><name>Calaburnay — Vicente T-1722 (H-36999, CARP Psd-05-020842)</name>
<description>Vicente Inocalla's OTHER titled land: Lot 1, H-36999 (orig. survey May 7, 1924; OCT I-108 of Jan 27, 1926; TCT T-1722 of Jul 6, 1956), Brgy. Malaguit (now Calaburnay), Paracale, 164,337 sqm. CARP-subdivided 1996 as Psd-05-020842 (AR) into Lots 1-A..1-H; CLOAs T-3827..T-3833 registered Sept 29, 1998 (per DAR letter Sept 16, 2019; tax dec still in Vicente's name). Markers below are corner-1 TIE POINTS computed from the plan's tie table (from BLLM No. 1, Municipality of Paracale — registry id 52594) — inferred_strong: individual OCR digits unverified; two table rows (1-A, 1-C) excluded as internally inconsistent. Sublot POLYGONS withheld: OCR'd traverses fail closure (567 m / 198 m) — pending clean scans.</description>
